  "title": "Remuera Vets - CareVets",
  "text": "Remuera Vets - CareVets\nFreephone 0800 227 383\nfor the best possible pet care\nHome\nAbout\nAbout Us\nCareers\nCareVets Charitable Foundation Trust\nServices\nVeterinary Services\nVaccinations\nDesexing\nMicrochipping\nKitten & Puppy Care\nEmergencies\nRadiology & Diagnostics\nSurgery\nDentistry\nWeight Management\nSenior Care\nBehavioural Consultations\nExotics Care\nPet Export Services\nSpecialist Referrals\nPet Food & Nutrition\nFleas & Worms\nGrooming\nPuppy Preschool\nLifestyle, Large Animal & Equine\nClinics\nAuckland\nBeach Road\nGlen Eden\nHobsonville\nMt Wellington\nOratia\nPukekohe\nRemuera\nTe Atatu\nWaiuku\nBay of Plenty\nCareVets Cameron Road\nWaikato\nChartwell\nHamilton South\nHorsham Downs\nPokeno\nRototuna\nGisborne\nGisborne\nHawke’s Bay\nNapier\nWellington\nJohnsonville\nKapiti\nKilbirnie\nPorirua\nWainuiomata\nContact\nAsk the Team\nCareers\nRequest Appointment\nSearch for:\n$\n0.00\nYour cart is currently empty.\n0800 227 383\nRemuera Vets\nRemuera Vets has a suite of medical, diagnostic and surgical facilities along with a range of pet food and supplies. We can help with a sore tooth, a mystery lump, an itchy paw and everything in between. We also offer puppy preschool to help teach your newest canine family member the basics and offer a safe environment for early socialisation.\nAddress:\n23 Ascot Avenue, Remuera, Auckland 1050\nPhone: (09) 520 1647\nEmail:\nreception@remvets.co.nz\nOr\ncontact us here\n.\nCheck out our\nwebsite here\n.\nFollow us on Facebook\nFollow us on Instagram\nOpening Hours:\nMonday\n8:00am – 7:00pm\nTuesday\n8:00am – 7:00pm\nWednesday\n8:00am – 7:00pm\nThursday\n8:00am – 7:00pm\nFriday\n8:00am – 6:00pm\nSaturday\n9:00am – 4:00pm\nSunday\n9:00am – 3:00pm\nPublic Holidays\nCLOSED\nIf you require veterinary attention outside of our opening hours please contact your nearest After Hours Vet:\nAnimal Emergency at VSA – Sylvia Park\n:\n09 849 2121\nOur Team:\nDr Colin Hill\nBVSc\nLead Veterinarian\nDr Heenal\nVeterinarian\nDr Xenia\nVeterinarian\nBrittany\nClinic Coordinator\nJustine\nLead Veterinary Nurse\nDarnelle\nSenior Veterinary Nurse\nRachel\nSenior Veterinary Nurse\nKennedy\nVeterinary Nurse\nRae\nLead Front of House\nTania\nReceptionist\nTania comes from over 20 years of front of house experience. She has a huge love of animals and being part of the health and general wellbeing of all animals. Tania has had many rescue pets over the years, and currently has two rescued kittens, a very naughty old Labrador and a Maine Coon cat. She enjoys spending time with friends and family, watching rugby, boating and classic car cruises.\nContact Us\nCareers\nCareVets Foundation\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\nStaff Intranet\nSubscribe to our newsletter\nEmail\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\nComment\nEmail\n(Required)\n\nΔ\nWeb Development\nby Graphic Detail Ltd. Copyright 2022.",
